UPDATE goals SET description = 'On the morning of December 25th, a poignant and symbolic date, the newly formed Fellowship of the Ring departed from the sanctuary of Rivendell. They crossed the Ford of Bruinen, the same river that had saved Frodo weeks earlier, and began their new, urgent quest to destroy the One Ring. Leaving the sanctuary behind, they stepped once more into the wild, on a path that was long and perilous, taking them into the heart of Middle-earth on a journey from which there could be no return.' WHERE distance = 466 * 1.60934;

