UPDATE goals SET description = 'The Fellowship began their ascent up the northern side of Hollin Ridge, nearing the border of the region of Eregion, a landmark on their path to the mountains. This part of the journey was a difficult, uphill climb that tested their physical endurance. It was a sign that they were leaving the more gentle lands behind and entering a more treacherous and foreboding landscape, a place of immense peril and a grim reminder of the difficult path they had chosen.' WHERE distance = 686 * 1.60934;

